(* Beginning of Notebook Content *)
Notebook[{
Cell["Rewriting Basics", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"71eb9992-6b0f-414f-8661-43f9054906ae"],

Cell["\<\
WolframInstitute`HypergraphRewriting \[LongDash] a second take on rewriting \
systems\
\>", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"f52bebe1-b139-3a4b-8672-7ff73a3d05e6"],

Cell["\<\
A rewriting system is a set of rules and a state to start from. Evolving it \
gives states, events and the causal relations between them. This is a \
separate stack from the one in src/, written from the ground up rather than \
following the upstream paclets, to be compared against it and either adopted \
or dropped.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"131fb59c-837b-964e-be16-72271dd8b28c"],

Cell["\<\
It takes as given everything up to and including rule application \[LongDash] \
Hypergraph, HypergraphPlot, HypergraphRule, HypergraphRuleApply, and the \
pictures of rules and events. Everything above that is new. Everything below \
is live output.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"30552340-ab72-e84e-bdc7-57ae34d37e96"],

Cell["Loading", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"d957f8d3-1e17-ed4f-bfd4-25aa0efc04fa"],

Cell["\<\
PacletDirectoryLoad[ParentDirectory[ParentDirectory[NotebookDirectory[]]]];
Needs[\"WolframInstitute`Hypergraphs`\"];
Get[FileNameJoin[{ParentDirectory[NotebookDirectory[]], \"RewritingSystems.wl\
\"}]]\
\>", "Input",
 InitializationCell->
  True,ExpressionUUID->"17c03421-c132-964f-9b3d-98042ac4966d"],

Cell["1. A system is rules and a state", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"8f54188e-f58d-e640-937d-eef757687baa"],

Cell["\<\
RewritingSystem takes the rules and where to start. A rule may be written as \
a plain arrow, and the state as anything Hypergraph accepts:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b5b6323e-aa82-8d42-bc69-4e94e3350c78"],

Cell["\<\
sys = RewritingSystem[{{1, 2}} -> {{1, 3}, {3, 2}}, {{1, 2}, {2, 3}}]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"0afc2ba0-f4ce-6b42-8282-55d23f21646b"],

