Cell["\<\
It shows itself as what it is: the rules drawn, and the state they start \
from. Open the summary box above. On its own, the rule subdivides an edge:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"98710836-b3bc-304e-8d0e-f8714f4d87b7"],

