Cell["\<\
Equal means equal up to canonical form, which is what makes it merge at all: \
a rewrite names the vertices it creates after what was already there, so two \
branches that reach the same shape almost never reach it under the same names.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"84389a58-bf33-2d4a-9b24-4f8340bf1277"],

Cell["\<\
{VertexCount @ ev[\"StatesGraph\", \"Draw\" -> False],
  VertexCount @ ev[\"StatesGraph\", \"MergeStates\" -> False, \"Draw\" -> \
False]}\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"cdba1e18-0609-c641-8990-db6242231ae3"],

