Cell["\<\
States and events both, alternating: a state, the event that acted on it, the \
state that came out. The wide panels are the events, each showing what it \
matched and what it made:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0a1a7bc8-3305-6e44-bb04-c64dc84ef1ab"],

