Cell["4. Tokens, which is the whole idea", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"26fa3141-d3a3-7a44-a63f-385bb4ed81e3"],

Cell["\<\
Every edge of every state is a token. A token is created by exactly one \
event, consumed by at most one, and has no other history:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a9a15bed-464b-bc4c-9726-4d3bb88b1a9a"],

